+ Switch is Toggle

────────────────────
+ This
    - title = ""

────────────────────

<This
    <Box • switch-track flex-row
        align-y = Alignment.center

        <Box • switch-lead
        <Box • switch-knob
    if #title != ""
        <Label • switch-title
            align-y = Alignment.center
            text = #title
